{"n":38,"v":[["Sâd. Par le Coran, au renom glorieux (dikr)","",[[["صٓ","P","INL|",-1]],[["وَ","P","P|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["قُرْءَانِ","N","PN|M|GEN",163]],[["ذِى","N","MS|GEN|ADJ",68]],[["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["ذِّكْرِ","N","VN|VF:1|M|GEN",140]]]],["Ceux qui ont mécru sont plutôt dans l'orgueil et le schisme","",[[["بَلِ","P","RET",88]],[["ٱلَّذِينَ","N","REL|MP",7]],[["كَفَرُ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MP",37],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["فِى","P","P",3]],[["عِزَّةٍ","N","F|INDEF|GEN",758]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["شِقَاقٍ","N","VN|VF:3|M|INDEF|GEN",1018]]]],["Que de générations avant eux avons-Nous fait périr, qui ont crié, hélas, quand il n'était plus temps d'échapper","",[[["كَمْ","N","ACC",474]],[["أَهْلَكْ","V","PERF|VF:4|1P",218],["نَا","N","PRON|SUFF|1P",-1]],[["مِن","P","P",0]],[["قَبْلِ","N","GEN",48],["هِم","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["مِّن","P","P",0]],[["قَرْنٍ","N","M|INDEF|GEN",443]],[["فَ","P","REM|PREF|LEM:ف",-1],["نَادَ","V","PERF|VF:3|3MP",252],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["وَّ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["لَاتَ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",4051]],[["حِينَ","N","M|ACC",315]],[["مَنَاصٍ","N","M|INDEF|GEN",4052]]]],["Et ils (les Mecquois) s'étonnèrent qu'un avertisseur parmi eux leur soit venu, et les infidèles disent: «C'est un magicien et un grand menteur","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["عَجِبُ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MP",981],["وٓا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["أَن","P","SUB",17]],[["جَآءَ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",40],["هُم","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["مُّنذِرٌ","N","ACT_PCPL|VF:4|M|INDEF|NOM",604]],[["مِّنْ","P","P",0],["هُمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["قَالَ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",5]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["كَٰفِرُونَ","N","ACT_PCPL|VF:1|MP|NOM",67]],[["هَٰ","P","ATT|PREF|LEM:ه",-1],["ذَا","N","DEM|MS",10]],[["سَٰحِرٌ","N","ACT_PCPL|VF:1|M|INDEF|NOM",461]],[["كَذَّابٌ","N","MS|INDEF|NOM|ADJ",1423]]]],["Réduira-t-il les divinités à un Seul Dieu? Voilà une chose vraiment étonnante»","",[[["أَ","N","INTG|PREF|LEM:أ",-1],["جَعَلَ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",30]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["ءَالِهَةَ","N","MP|ACC",73]],[["إِلَٰهًا","N","MS|INDEF|ACC",73]],[["وَٰحِدًا","N","MS|INDEF|ACC|ADJ",350]],[["إِنَّ","P","ACC|FAM:إِنّ",4]],[["هَٰ","P","ATT|PREF|LEM:ه",-1],["ذَا","N","DEM|MS",10]],[["لَ","P","EMPH|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["شَىْءٌ","N","M|INDEF|NOM",38]],[["عُجَابٌ","N","MS|INDEF|NOM|ADJ",4053]]]],["Et leurs notables partirent en disant: «Allez-vous en, et restez constants à vos dieux: c'est là vraiment une chose souhaitable","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱنطَلَقَ","V","PERF|VF:7|3MS",923]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["مَلَأُ","N","M|NOM",355]],[["مِنْ","P","P",0],["هُمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["أَنِ","P","INT",17]],[["ٱمْشُ","V","IMPV|VF:1|2MP",467],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|2MP",-1]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱصْبِرُ","V","IMPV|VF:1|2MP",190],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|2MP",-1]],[["عَلَىٰٓ","P","P",8]],[["ءَالِهَتِ","N","MP|GEN",73],["كُمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|2MP",-1]],[["إِنَّ","P","ACC|FAM:إِنّ",4]],[["هَٰ","P","ATT|PREF|LEM:ه",-1],["ذَا","N","DEM|MS",10]],[["لَ","P","EMPH|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["شَىْءٌ","N","M|INDEF|NOM",38]],[["يُرَادُ","V","IMPF|VF:4|PASS|3MS|MOOD:IND",78]]]],["Nous n'avons pas entendu cela dans la dernière religion (le Christianisme); ce n'est en vérité que pure invention","",[[["مَا","P","NEG",12]],[["سَمِعْ","V","PERF|VF:1|1P",134],["نَا","N","PRON|SUFF|1P",-1]],[["بِ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ب",-1],["هَٰ","P","ATT|PREF|LEM:ه",-1],["ذَا","N","DEM|MS",10]],[["فِى","P","P",3]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["مِلَّةِ","N","F|GEN",602]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["ءَاخِرَةِ","N","FS|GEN",69]],[["إِنْ","P","NEG",15]],[["هَٰ","P","ATT|PREF|LEM:ه",-1],["ذَآ","N","DEM|MS",10]],[["إِلَّا","P","RES",16]],[["ٱخْتِلَٰقٌ","N","VN|VF:8|M|INDEF|NOM",4054]]]],["Quoi! C'est sur lui, parmi nous, qu'on aurait fait descendre le Rappel [le Coran]?» Plutôt ils sont dans le doute au sujet de Mon message. Ou plutôt ils n'ont pas encore goûté à Mon châtiment","",[[["أَ","N","INTG|PREF|LEM:أ",-1],["ءُنزِلَ","V","PERF|VF:4|PASS|3MS",57]],[["عَلَيْ","P","P",8],["هِ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MS",-1]],[["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["ذِّكْرُ","N","VN|VF:1|M|NOM",140]],[["مِنۢ","P","P",0]],[["بَيْنِ","N","GEN",44],["نَا","N","PRON|SUFF|1P",-1]],[["بَلْ","P","RET",88]],[["هُمْ","N","PRON|3MP",-1]],[["فِى","P","P",3]],[["شَكٍّ","N","M|INDEF|GEN",617]],[["مِّن","P","P",0]],[["ذِكْرِ","N","VN|VF:1|M|GEN",140],["ى","N","PRON|SUFF|1S",-1]],[["بَل","P","RET",88]],[["لَّمَّا","P","NEG",761]],[["يَذُوقُ","V","IMPF|VF:1|3MP|MOOD:JUS",310],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["عَذَابِ","N","M|ACC",33],["","N","PRON|SUFF|1S",-1]]]],["Ou bien détiennent-ils les trésors de la miséricorde de ton Seigneur, le Puissant, le Dispensateur par excellence","",[[["أَمْ","P","CONJ",79]],[["عِندَ","N","LOC|ACC",55],["هُمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["خَزَآئِنُ","N","MP|NOM",976]],[["رَحْمَةِ","N","F|GEN",96]],[["رَبِّ","N","M|GEN",11],["كَ","N","PRON|SUFF|2MS",-1]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["عَزِيزِ","N","MS|GEN|ADJ",104]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["وَهَّابِ","N","MS|GEN|ADJ",1749]]]],["Ou bien ont-ils le royaume des cieux et de la terre et de ce qui existe entre eux? Eh bien, qu'ils y montent par n'importe quel moyen","",[[["أَمْ","P","CONJ",79]],[["لَ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["هُم","N","PRON|3MP",-1]],[["مُّلْكُ","N","M|NOM",234]],[["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["سَّمَٰوَٰتِ","N","FP|GEN",34]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["أَرْضِ","N","F|GEN",21]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["مَا","N","REL",6]],[["بَيْنَ","N","LOC|ACC",44],["هُمَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3D",-1]],[["فَ","P","REM|PREF|LEM:ف",-1],["لْ","P","IMPV|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["يَرْتَقُ","V","IMPF|VF:8|3MP|MOOD:JUS",4055],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["فِى","P","P",3]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["أَسْبَٰبِ","N","MP|GEN",872]]]],["Une armée de coalisés qui, ici-même, sera mise en déroute","",[[["جُن