ous ne faisant qu'obéir à lui [Allah]","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["طَّيْرَ","N","M|ACC",507]],[["مَحْشُورَةً","N","PASS_PCPL|VF:1|F|INDEF|ACC",4060]],[["كُلٌّ","N","M|INDEF|NOM",28]],[["لَّ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["هُۥٓ","N","PRON|3MS",-1]],[["أَوَّابٌ","N","MS|INDEF|NOM",1225]]]],["Et Nous renforçâmes son royaume et lui donnâmes la sagesse et la faculté de bien juger","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["شَدَدْ","V","PERF|VF:1|1P",1208],["نَا","N","PRON|SUFF|1P",-1]],[["مُلْكَ","N","M|ACC",234],["هُۥ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MS",-1]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ءَاتَيْ","V","PERF|VF:4|1P",42],["نَٰ","N","PRON|SUFF|1P",-1],["هُ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MS",-1]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["حِكْمَةَ","N","F|ACC",485]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["فَصْلَ","N","M|ACC",928]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["خِطَابِ","N","M|GEN",2055]]]],["Et t'est-elle parvenue la nouvelle des disputeurs quand ils grimpèrent au mur du sanctuaire","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["هَلْ","P","INTG",108]],[["أَتَىٰ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",45],["كَ","N","PRON|SUFF|2MS",-1]],[["نَبَؤُا۟","N","M|NOM",366]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["خَصْمِ","N","M|GEN",2013]],[["إِذْ","N","T",35]],[["تَسَوَّرُ","V","PERF|VF:5|3MP",4061],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["مِحْرَابَ","N","M|ACC",1478]]]],["Quand ils entrèrent auprès de David, il en fut effrayé. Ils dirent: «N'aie pas peur! Nous sommes tous deux en dispute; l'un de nous a fait du tort à l'autre. Juge donc en toute équité entre nous, ne sois pas injuste et guide-nous vers le chemin droit","",[[["إِذْ","N","T",35]],[["دَخَلُ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MP",138],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["عَلَىٰ","P","P",8]],[["دَاوُۥدَ","N","PN|GEN",578]],[["فَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:ف",-1],["فَزِعَ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",2037]],[["مِنْ","P","P",0],["هُمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["قَالُ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MP",5],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["لَا","P","PRO",2]],[["تَخَفْ"